; BlobChaser — prototype enemy. Layer 4 (enemies), masks 1+2+8 = 11
; (world walls + hero + gravestone). Walks through other enemies
; freely so a pack doesn't traffic-jam.
;
; Visual: 28-px red circle. No anim, no shadow, no telegraph.

